@@ -0,0 +1,7 @@
+"""The typed Lead surface: one contract below every transport (F15 v0.4 §5, §12, §15; architecture review T1).
+
+* :mod:`aew.surface.contract` is the catalog: every tool, its argument schema, its primitives and its class.
+* :mod:`aew.surface.run` runs a tool against the Engine with a Lead credential and returns a ``StageResult``.
+* :mod:`aew.surface.projection` derives the ``ActionProjection`` every result carries.
+* :mod:`aew.surface.mcp` is the MCP (stdio) transport; ``aew lead tool`` is the CLI transport. Both call ``run``.
+"""
